{"synopsis":"[Unique Trait ‘Skill Master (EX)’ telah diaktifkan.]\n▶ ‘Skill Copy (EX)’ telah tersedia.\n\nMulai sekarang, tidak ada skill yang tidak bisa dia miliki. Milikmu adalah milikku. Milikku? Masih milikku.\n\nDengan kekuatan untuk menyalin skill apa pun yang dia saksikan, Yoo Ju-yeon memulai perjalanan legendaris ke atas — mengakali saingan, mengalahkan pahlawan, dan mengumpulkan setiap skill yang ada.\n\nMunculnya protagonis kelas cheat utama dimulai sekarang. Semua saga peledak Skill Master Yoo Ju-yeon baru saja dimulai!\n\n11,376","alternative_title":"Master of All Skills, Skill Collector: The Ultimate Skill Thief, 올 스킬 마스터","author":"触手动漫","artist":"触手动漫","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"55ed82c5-f67a-4e55-8bab-296e88bdb320","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"","date":"2026-02-05","released":"2026-02-05"},{"chapter_id":"41f5c027-f06b-433a-a145-a15d5cc6952b","number":"44","chapter":"44","title":"","date":"2026-01-28","released":"2026-01-28"},{"chapter_id":"b445899e-3bfc-44c4-a34d-8d3ef5838876","number":"43","chapter":"43","title":"","date":"2026-01-28","released":"2026-01-28"},{"chapter_id":"ffa607e4-fe59-48dd-af7f-fc6c9f4b528f","number":"42","chapter":"42","title":"","date":"2026-01-28","released":"2026-01-28"},{"chapter_id":"84485f43-09e2-4d93-b79b-7a4b847d3761","number":"41","chapter":"41","title":"","date":"2026-01-28","released":"2026-01-28"},{"chapter_id":"7fb733ea-0198-4218-9d44-4961334362d9","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"","date":"2026-01-28","released":"2026-01-28"},{"chapter_id":"615d6549-cee1-450d-a88a-0e2f3777abfa","number":"39","chapter":"39","title":"","date":"2026-01-28","released":"2026-01-28"},{"chapter_id":"0eca4fd0-4065-40d4-ad16-3dbfc2dd9188","number":"38","chapter":"38","title":"","date":"2025-10-26","released":"2025-10-26"},{"chapter_id":"704fb8b8-1847-4d89-a39f-1c767aee7d54","number":"37","chapter":"37","title":"","date":"2025-10-23","released":"2025-10-23"},{"chapter_id":"64c0d640-b32e-4579-98ec-22cbec77e0c9","number":"36","ch